WEBVTT

00:00:03.940 --> 00:00:08.070
That reminds me, Koharu.
Didn’t you say you wanted to meet a Nymphia?

00:00:08.070 --> 00:00:08.860
Yeah.

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:11.700
Nymphia is the only one
of her evolutions I haven’t met.

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:14.330
In fact,
I got a message from Kairi.

00:00:14.740 --> 00:00:16.120
Kairi...

00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:17.750
The man with the Showers?

00:00:19.670 --> 00:00:20.750
Yes.

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:24.840
Apparently, there’s a Nymphia and trainer
garnering attention...

00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:27.760
...in Pokémon Contests at Minamo City,
where he comes from.

00:00:28.590 --> 00:00:32.970
Nymphia. Intertwining Pokémon.
Fairy type.

00:00:32.970 --> 00:00:38.890
It sends a soothing aura from
its ribbonlike feelers to calm fights.

00:00:39.310 --> 00:00:43.480
If it wraps its ribbonlike feelers around its trainer’s arm,
it can read their feelings.

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:46.400
It <i>does</i> look like
it would be good at Contests!

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:47.900
Want to go and see?

00:00:48.280 --> 00:00:49.700
Dad!

00:00:49.700 --> 00:00:50.910
Of course!

00:00:50.910 --> 00:00:52.910
Right, Eevee?

00:00:53.870 --> 00:00:58.040
Actually, Go and Satoshi are
headed to Minamo City right now, too.

00:00:58.040 --> 00:00:58.620
Huh?

00:00:58.620 --> 00:01:02.540
I want to catch a Tyltalis now!
Like the one Satoshi battled!

00:01:02.540 --> 00:01:05.800
So we’re heading off
to Minamo City!

00:01:05.800 --> 00:01:08.670
So do you think you can
meet them there?

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:09.800
Okay!

00:01:10.340 --> 00:01:12.390
Then, off to Minamo City...

00:01:12.390 --> 00:01:15.640
Let’s go!

00:02:52.740 --> 00:02:56.610
Minamo City, Hoenn Region

00:02:53.190 --> 00:02:56.610
This is Minamo City in Hoenn.

00:02:56.610 --> 00:03:01.080
When Koharu and Eevee
arrived at the Contest Hall...

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:03.500
Hiiiiii, ev-er-y-bo-dy!

00:03:06.210 --> 00:03:09.040
Well then, watch me as
I dive right in again today!

00:03:09.040 --> 00:03:11.590
Shining and spinning...

00:03:11.590 --> 00:03:13.130
<i>Spinning...</i>

00:03:14.010 --> 00:03:17.720
Miracle Ruthia’s Contest Scouting!

00:03:17.720 --> 00:03:18.340
This is it!

00:03:18.340 --> 00:03:23.470
All righty! I’ll be bringing another
spectacular trainer into Contesting!

00:03:18.340 --> 00:03:19.220
Ruthie!

00:03:19.220 --> 00:03:20.970
Scout me to be your next boyfriend!

00:03:20.970 --> 00:03:23.470
Ruthia!

00:03:24.180 --> 00:03:26.310
Let’s see...

00:03:26.730 --> 00:03:29.230
You there, watching me with
that baffled expression!

00:03:29.230 --> 00:03:30.820
What? Me?

00:03:30.820 --> 00:03:32.980
Have you never joined
in a Contest?

00:03:32.980 --> 00:03:34.360
Umm, no...

00:03:34.360 --> 00:03:36.110
That’s just what I want to hear!

00:03:36.110 --> 00:03:40.490
Then let’s get this show on the road!
This is the trainer I’m gonna scout today!

00:03:40.490 --> 00:03:41.950
Huh?! Scout?!

00:03:42.370 --> 00:03:43.330
And your name is...?

00:03:43.330 --> 00:03:46.830
Um, hold on a minute!
I’m not too good with these things...

00:03:46.830 --> 00:03:48.210
I just need your name!

00:03:48.670 --> 00:03:49.960
Okay?

00:03:56.970 --> 00:04:00.720
Aw...
Just when I finally found a Tyltalis...

00:04:00.720 --> 00:04:02.350
Are you ready, Koharu?

00:04:02.350 --> 00:04:07.060
Strength isn’t all that matters
at this Contest Hall’s Contest Lives.

00:04:02.720 --> 00:04:03.720
Koharu?!

00:04:07.060 --> 00:04:10.190
You can see a whole new
brilliant side to Pokémon!

00:04:10.190 --> 00:04:12.110
A whole new brilliant side...

00:04:12.110 --> 00:04:12.730
That’s right!

00:04:13.190 --> 00:04:16.240
I bet Eevee has a whole new
brilliant side, too!

00:04:16.240 --> 00:04:18.110
That’s what I want you to know!

00:04:18.110 --> 00:04:20.070
So here you go! Take these!

00:04:20.070 --> 00:04:23.740
A Pass that lets you take part in Contest Lives,
and a Polock Case!

00:04:23.740 --> 00:04:27.870
Koharu and Eevee’s story
begins today!

00:04:27.870 --> 00:04:30.670
Yep! And this episode
should be titled...

00:04:30.670 --> 00:04:34.920
“A Sudden Encounter! Scouted by a Miracle Idol!”
That’s what I’d call it!

00:04:34.920 --> 00:04:38.800
That’s all for today
from Minamo City’s Contest Hall!

00:04:38.800 --> 00:04:40.930
Bye-bye!

00:04:40.930 --> 00:04:41.930
Ruthie!

00:04:41.930 --> 00:04:42.760
You’re so cute!

00:04:42.760 --> 00:04:46.140
So, Koharu, try your hand at
a Contest for me, okay?

00:04:46.140 --> 00:04:47.680
Huh?! Uh, um...

00:04:52.560 --> 00:04:54.900
Eevee?
Where are you going?

00:04:56.400 --> 00:04:57.570
Fairy Wind!

00:05:01.660 --> 00:05:03.370
It’s a Nymphia...

00:05:08.700 --> 00:05:09.830
Ooh!

00:05:09.830 --> 00:05:12.040
You’re the one
Ruthia just scouted!

00:05:12.040 --> 00:05:13.460
Huh? How do you...?

00:05:13.460 --> 00:05:15.000
I saw you live on TV.

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:17.550
What?!
Oh no, that’s so embarrassing...

00:05:18.630 --> 00:05:21.720
My name is Serena.
This is Nymphia.

00:05:21.720 --> 00:05:23.180
Your Eevee’s really cute!

00:05:23.550 --> 00:05:25.300
Thank you.

00:05:25.300 --> 00:05:27.180
Do you happen to do Contests?

00:05:27.180 --> 00:05:27.890
Yes.

00:05:27.890 --> 00:05:31.390
So you’re the Nymphia trainer
garnering all the attention!

00:05:31.390 --> 00:05:33.810
I don’t know if I’d say that,

00:05:33.810 --> 00:05:37.230
but I like to think I’ve been
livening up Hoenn’s Contests with Ruthia.

00:05:37.230 --> 00:05:41.650
I wanted to let Eevee see
one of your performances with Nymphia,

00:05:41.650 --> 00:05:43.200
so I came here from Kanto!

00:05:43.780 --> 00:05:45.160
Let Eevee see?

00:05:48.580 --> 00:05:50.330
I see...

00:05:50.330 --> 00:05:52.460
I really like that.

00:05:52.460 --> 00:05:53.210
Huh?

00:05:54.040 --> 00:05:58.170
Eevee choosing what to evolve into,
instead of her trainer choosing for her.

00:05:58.170 --> 00:06:01.260
While that may sound easy,
it’s actually quite hard.

00:06:01.260 --> 00:06:03.010
Really?

00:06:03.010 --> 00:06:04.010
Yeah.

00:06:04.010 --> 00:06:05.680
For example, you see Nymphia?

00:06:06.350 --> 00:06:08.510
She was an Eevee who
was great at dancing.

00:06:09.430 --> 00:06:12.770
I invited her to join us,
saying she’d have more fun dancing with friends.

00:06:14.100 --> 00:06:16.270
And so, we traveled together...

00:06:16.270 --> 00:06:19.030
Along the way, our hearts united...

00:06:19.030 --> 00:06:21.400
Then she turned into a Nymphia...

00:06:21.400 --> 00:06:22.150
Yeah!

00:06:23.530 --> 00:06:25.780
So, has your Eevee decided?

00:06:26.160 --> 00:06:27.700
What to evolve into?

00:06:27.700 --> 00:06:29.080
Not yet.

00:06:29.080 --> 00:06:30.410
I see.

00:06:30.410 --> 00:06:31.330
Ms. Serena...

00:06:31.330 --> 00:06:34.000
Just Serena is fine.
You don’t have to be all polite with me.

00:06:34.000 --> 00:06:36.130
Just call me Koharu too, then.

00:06:36.130 --> 00:06:39.800
What set you down
the path of Contests, Serena?

00:06:40.550 --> 00:06:45.890
I’m just like Eevee.
I can’t decide what I want to do.

00:06:45.890 --> 00:06:48.890
Then you’re just like
how I used to be.

00:06:48.890 --> 00:06:49.810
Huh?

00:06:50.350 --> 00:06:55.440
I went out traveling without any sort of dreams
or goals to aim for...

00:06:56.230 --> 00:06:57.230
But...

00:06:57.230 --> 00:06:59.980
I saw amazing
Pokémon performances,

00:06:59.980 --> 00:07:01.610
and they awed me...

00:07:01.610 --> 00:07:06.910
Now I hope I can become a performer
who can give strength to everyone who watches me.

00:07:09.120 --> 00:07:12.370
Working toward your dream
is so much fun!

00:07:12.370 --> 00:07:15.670
Sometimes things might not go too well,
and you get depressed...

00:07:15.670 --> 00:07:19.170
but that just gives you so much more joy
when you <i>do</i> succeed!

00:07:20.710 --> 00:07:25.170
When you’re talking about your dreams, Serena,
it’s like you’re sparkling...

00:07:25.170 --> 00:07:26.430
Really?

00:07:26.430 --> 00:07:28.260
Maybe it’s because
I’m with Pokémon.

00:07:28.260 --> 00:07:32.180
Incoming call from Go.
Incoming call from Go.

00:07:30.010 --> 00:07:32.180
Oh, sorry!

00:07:32.180 --> 00:07:33.720
Incoming call fro—

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:34.520
Hello?

00:07:34.520 --> 00:07:36.810
Koharu, you’re gonna
participate in a Contest?!

00:07:36.810 --> 00:07:39.360
Oh, you saw that too, Go...

00:07:39.360 --> 00:07:41.400
Um... I’m still not entirely sure.

00:07:41.400 --> 00:07:44.570
Well, we’ll head to the Contest Hall
to come join you, then!

00:07:44.570 --> 00:07:45.530
See ya!

00:07:45.900 --> 00:07:48.820
Got it.
Then, let’s meet up at—

00:07:49.780 --> 00:07:51.740
Sheesh...

00:07:51.740 --> 00:07:53.660
What will you do, Koharu?

00:07:53.660 --> 00:07:54.660
Huh?

00:07:54.660 --> 00:07:56.540
Your friends are
coming too, right?

00:07:56.540 --> 00:08:00.000
Hmm... What <i>should</i> I do?

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:02.130
Eevee, what do you think?

00:08:04.590 --> 00:08:05.920
What about you, Serena?

00:08:05.920 --> 00:08:07.970
What indeed...?

00:08:07.970 --> 00:08:11.430
“If you’re ever hesitating,
then get yourself moving!”

00:08:11.430 --> 00:08:14.010
“Even if you fail,
you’ll still be left with <i>something.</i>”

00:08:14.010 --> 00:08:16.310
“Nothing you do is ever pointless.”
That’s what I think.

00:08:16.680 --> 00:08:18.980
I can help you get ready!

00:08:19.650 --> 00:08:22.060
Right! Let’s give it a try!

00:08:26.150 --> 00:08:27.280
Is that it?

00:08:27.280 --> 00:08:29.200
Yeah, looks like we’ll make it!

00:08:29.200 --> 00:08:31.240
If it isn’t Satoshi!

00:08:32.830 --> 00:08:34.290
I thought so.

00:08:34.290 --> 00:08:36.620
Do you remember me?

00:08:36.620 --> 00:08:38.620
Umm...

00:08:39.040 --> 00:08:42.880
If you cannot recognize such a marvel,
you are not worthy to know my name.

00:08:42.880 --> 00:08:44.630
See ya then!

00:08:44.630 --> 00:08:46.760
Stop right there.

00:08:46.760 --> 00:08:51.510
Remember how your friends
Haruka and Hikari entered the <i>Mikuri</i> Cup?

00:08:51.510 --> 00:08:54.010
Oh!
<i>Now</i> I remember!

00:08:54.010 --> 00:08:56.140
You’re Mr. Mikuri,
the Contest Master!

00:08:57.180 --> 00:08:59.640
I knew you could
never forget me.

00:08:59.640 --> 00:09:04.940
You see, my niece, the Top Idol, Ruthia,
is performing in Contests...

00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:09.070
Excuse me, we have to
get going to watch that Contest...

00:09:09.070 --> 00:09:11.490
Apparently it’s about to start.

00:09:11.490 --> 00:09:12.950
See ya then!

00:09:12.950 --> 00:09:15.660
Now, now,
don’t be in such a hurry.

00:09:15.660 --> 00:09:20.620
I have caught every one of your
Pokémon World Championship battles.

00:09:20.620 --> 00:09:22.370
Oh, thank you...

00:09:22.370 --> 00:09:26.170
While I am not competing,
our meeting today must be a stroke of fate.

00:09:26.170 --> 00:09:28.130
Why don’t we have a battle?

00:09:28.130 --> 00:09:29.090
Huh?!

00:09:29.090 --> 00:09:32.640
I can hold my own against
the Champion of the Hoenn Region.

00:09:32.640 --> 00:09:34.930
What?! Against Mr. Daigo?!

00:09:34.930 --> 00:09:38.390
Hmph... So you have no problem
remembering Daigo...

00:09:38.390 --> 00:09:40.680
No matter.
I am in no way offended.

00:09:40.680 --> 00:09:42.980
We don’t have time
to battle right now...

00:09:42.980 --> 00:09:44.190
I’d love to!

00:09:44.190 --> 00:09:45.690
You’re doing it anyway?!

00:09:45.690 --> 00:09:49.530
Now, show me.
Show me the power you wield with your Pokémon.

00:09:49.530 --> 00:09:54.780
And I, in turn, shall present you with
a performance of illusions in water by me and my Pokémon!

00:09:56.370 --> 00:09:59.290
Oh... What should I pick...?

00:09:59.290 --> 00:10:01.210
Go with whatever you like.

00:10:01.210 --> 00:10:03.500
Oh, this one’s cute!

00:10:03.500 --> 00:10:06.340
But... Maybe a bit gaudy...

00:10:06.340 --> 00:10:10.010
That dress was worn by the
“Dancing Girl of Hoenn!”

00:10:10.010 --> 00:10:12.260
You’re bound to look good in it, too!

00:10:15.180 --> 00:10:20.220
When you’re all dressed up, and standing onstage...
You might just discover a new side to yourself!

00:10:21.560 --> 00:10:24.350
And not just you...
The same goes for Eevee.

00:10:25.560 --> 00:10:27.690
Ta-daah!

00:10:27.690 --> 00:10:30.940
You should dress up too,
just like Koharu!

00:10:34.610 --> 00:10:37.580
You’ll be a shining star
on the stage!

00:10:37.580 --> 00:10:38.830
Together with Eevee!

00:10:38.830 --> 00:10:39.790
Huh?!

00:10:39.790 --> 00:10:41.910
Remember,
“if you’re ever hesitating”...

00:10:42.830 --> 00:10:46.710
“Then get yourself moving...”
Right?

00:10:46.710 --> 00:10:47.710
Correct!

00:10:48.170 --> 00:10:52.170
Well, then... Let’s work out
what kind of performance you want to do!

00:10:52.170 --> 00:10:53.220
Sure!

00:10:55.680 --> 00:10:57.390
Pocket Monsters.

00:11:06.560 --> 00:11:07.770
Now,

00:11:07.770 --> 00:11:13.570
the curtain rises on the Contest Live Minamo Competition,
where Pokémon compete with their charms!

00:11:14.030 --> 00:11:17.570
First up,
the Normal Rank Performance!

00:11:17.570 --> 00:11:19.780
It’s already started...

00:11:21.950 --> 00:11:23.330
Good work, Kairyu!

00:11:23.330 --> 00:11:25.620
Laglarge, use Muddy Water!

00:11:28.710 --> 00:11:31.920
Kinogassa!
Seed Machine Gun!

00:11:38.300 --> 00:11:41.180
Tamazarashi!
Aurora Beam!

00:11:48.150 --> 00:11:50.150
They’re all incredible...

00:11:51.110 --> 00:11:54.150
Is this really going to work?

00:11:54.150 --> 00:11:55.110
Koharu.

00:11:55.990 --> 00:11:58.030
Serena!

00:11:58.030 --> 00:11:59.240
Are you nervous?

00:11:59.240 --> 00:12:01.160
Am I ever...

00:12:01.160 --> 00:12:05.580
Nymphia and I were just the same,
when we first went on stage.

00:12:05.580 --> 00:12:09.120
But performers always have to
keep up a smile!

00:12:09.120 --> 00:12:10.290
Right.

00:12:10.290 --> 00:12:14.380
But I can’t help thinking,
“what if something goes wrong?”

00:12:14.380 --> 00:12:15.760
You’ll be fine!

00:12:16.090 --> 00:12:18.800
“You can’t do everything
on your own.”

00:12:18.800 --> 00:12:22.260
“Having Pokémon who support you
is what lets you keep going.”

00:12:23.310 --> 00:12:24.970
Believe in Eevee!

00:12:26.180 --> 00:12:27.270
Yeah.

00:12:27.270 --> 00:12:28.640
Let’s do our best together!

00:12:30.230 --> 00:12:32.020
The next performer...

00:12:32.020 --> 00:12:35.110
...is a Contest newcomer,
making her debut today. It’s Koharu!

00:12:35.110 --> 00:12:37.110
Koharu’s on, Satoshi!

00:12:37.110 --> 00:12:38.860
Uonoragon!
Use Water Gun!

00:12:38.860 --> 00:12:40.860
Take it head on,
Todoserga!

00:12:43.580 --> 00:12:46.200
Koharu’s on, Satoshi...

00:12:46.700 --> 00:12:49.960
Now, let’s go, Koharu!

00:12:55.300 --> 00:12:56.670
Director Sakuragi!

00:12:56.670 --> 00:12:57.420
You have to see this!

00:12:58.880 --> 00:13:01.220
Ko-Koharu?!

00:13:14.060 --> 00:13:16.320
Thank you, Eevee!

00:13:23.450 --> 00:13:25.740
Let’s put everything
into this move.

00:13:25.740 --> 00:13:28.370
All of the power
we’ve received from everyone!

00:13:52.600 --> 00:13:53.810
Fairy Wind!

00:13:59.940 --> 00:14:01.700
Use Tackle on the wind!

00:14:07.740 --> 00:14:09.330
She did it!

00:14:16.880 --> 00:14:21.840
Let’s hear some warm applause
for Koharu and Eevee’s Performance!

00:14:21.840 --> 00:14:24.680
Koharu, Eevee,
you were amazing...!

00:14:24.680 --> 00:14:26.680
Wasn’t that incredible,
Director?

00:14:29.890 --> 00:14:32.850
I was more nervous
watching her...

00:14:33.440 --> 00:14:35.770
Koharu, you were so cool!

00:14:37.060 --> 00:14:39.610
Uonoragon,
you did well out there!

00:14:37.690 --> 00:14:39.610
Return, Todoserga!

00:14:39.610 --> 00:14:40.190
It’s over?

00:14:41.860 --> 00:14:45.110
As I trusted,
that was a marvelous battle.

00:14:46.120 --> 00:14:47.120
Same for you, Mr. Mikuri!

00:14:47.740 --> 00:14:49.240
Now for the next one!

00:14:49.240 --> 00:14:51.250
Come on out, Milokaross!

00:14:49.240 --> 00:14:51.250
Pikachu, I choose you!

00:14:55.040 --> 00:14:57.330
You’re still at it...?

00:14:57.840 --> 00:15:02.300
Next up is what you’ve all been
waiting for, Master Rank!

00:15:02.300 --> 00:15:07.220
The Top Batter has solidified her popularity
throughout Kalos, and now even in Hoenn!

00:15:07.220 --> 00:15:09.050
It’s Serena!

00:15:14.730 --> 00:15:17.480
My heart’s pounding!

00:15:17.480 --> 00:15:19.570
Here we go, everyone!

00:15:20.400 --> 00:15:22.990
Mafoxy! Magical Flame!

00:15:22.990 --> 00:15:25.030
Yancham! Evil Pulse!

00:15:25.030 --> 00:15:27.490
Nymphia! Speed Star!

00:15:38.630 --> 00:15:40.710
Amazing... Amazing!

00:15:40.710 --> 00:15:42.670
Mafoxy! Flamethrower!

00:15:46.680 --> 00:15:48.760
Nymphia! Lightning Speed!

00:15:51.560 --> 00:15:53.680
Yancham! Ice Punch!

00:16:01.940 --> 00:16:04.280
Now for the finale!

00:16:17.210 --> 00:16:19.210
Finish!

00:16:27.420 --> 00:16:29.840
Serena, Nymphia...

00:16:29.840 --> 00:16:31.720
They’re all incredible!

00:16:32.180 --> 00:16:35.180
The Master Rank,
home of heated battles.

00:16:35.180 --> 00:16:41.480
Closing us out is Hoenn’s
Number One Contest Idol...

00:16:41.480 --> 00:16:45.440
It’s Miracle Ruthia!

00:16:45.440 --> 00:16:46.860
Shining!

00:16:46.860 --> 00:16:48.200
Spinning!

00:16:48.200 --> 00:16:49.950
<i>Spinning!</i>

00:16:49.950 --> 00:16:53.780
Miracle Ruthia’s Special Performance!

00:16:57.450 --> 00:17:00.000
Here we go, Tylulu!
White Mist!

00:17:02.790 --> 00:17:06.050
<i>Ruthia!</i>

00:17:07.670 --> 00:17:09.470
Mega Shining!

00:17:09.470 --> 00:17:10.550
Let’s go!

00:17:15.560 --> 00:17:18.020
Shine out even more!

00:17:30.280 --> 00:17:31.740
Draco Meteor!

00:17:41.870 --> 00:17:43.540
Return, Milokaross.

00:17:45.290 --> 00:17:50.260
For you to vanquish me,
an equal of Champion What’s-his-name...

00:17:50.260 --> 00:17:51.800
How wonderful it is!

00:17:51.800 --> 00:17:53.640
So vexingly elegant!

00:17:53.640 --> 00:17:55.760
Yet indeed glorious.

00:17:55.760 --> 00:17:58.890
Thank you for the good battle.
I knew you would deliver, Satoshi.

00:17:58.890 --> 00:18:01.850
My pleasure!
It was some good practice!

00:18:01.850 --> 00:18:03.560
Okay, let’s get going, Satoshi!

00:18:03.560 --> 00:18:04.600
Stop right there!

00:18:04.600 --> 00:18:05.610
Now...

00:18:06.190 --> 00:18:08.730
Accept this Rain Badge.

00:18:10.650 --> 00:18:11.530
Huh...

00:18:11.530 --> 00:18:12.530
We’ve gotta go!

00:18:12.530 --> 00:18:14.030
One more thing!

00:18:14.820 --> 00:18:18.120
Take this,
so you may never forget our battle.

00:18:18.120 --> 00:18:19.410
Huh.

00:18:19.790 --> 00:18:23.710
Many paths now stand open to you.

00:18:23.710 --> 00:18:26.630
On one hand,
you could conquer the Championships.

00:18:26.630 --> 00:18:27.290
Many P—

00:18:28.380 --> 00:18:30.050
Now, for the results!

00:18:30.050 --> 00:18:33.300
The victor of the Minamo Competition
Master Rank is...

00:18:34.260 --> 00:18:38.470
Two winners tied for the most points!
Ruthia and Serena!

00:18:38.470 --> 00:18:40.850
We did it! Congrats!

00:18:40.850 --> 00:18:42.350
Great work, Ruthia!

00:18:45.100 --> 00:18:46.060
<i>Ruthia!</i>

00:18:46.060 --> 00:18:47.610
<i>Serena!</i>

00:18:47.610 --> 00:18:53.530
...I will pray that your path
be a brilliant one.

00:18:53.900 --> 00:18:55.990
Thank you!

00:18:55.990 --> 00:18:58.370
A Tyltalis!

00:18:59.240 --> 00:19:01.080
Wait for me!

00:19:01.080 --> 00:19:02.250
Go?

00:19:05.790 --> 00:19:08.590
If you’d like, please take this.

00:19:09.290 --> 00:19:10.340
Is that okay?

00:19:10.340 --> 00:19:11.510
Of course!

00:19:11.510 --> 00:19:13.550
I’m sure she would be happy, too.

00:19:13.550 --> 00:19:15.550
Thank you, Nymphia!

00:19:16.840 --> 00:19:19.100
So, what did you think of Contests?

00:19:19.850 --> 00:19:24.850
Thanks to you, Serena, both Eevee and I
discovered a new side to ourselves.

00:19:24.850 --> 00:19:26.980
Thank you for being there
to push us forward!

00:19:26.980 --> 00:19:28.730
It’s nothing!

00:19:28.730 --> 00:19:32.480
It’s what a traveling companion of mine
always did for me,

00:19:32.480 --> 00:19:34.190
so now it’s my turn.

00:19:34.190 --> 00:19:37.320
Hey, what are you going
to do now, Serena?

00:19:37.320 --> 00:19:39.780
Oh, actually, Ruthia asked me...

00:19:40.240 --> 00:19:44.370
Hey, hey, hey!
Why don’t we start up an idol duo?!

00:19:44.370 --> 00:19:46.830
...and I’m not sure what to do.

00:19:48.040 --> 00:19:50.250
“If you have time
to spend hesitating...”

00:19:50.750 --> 00:19:52.670
“Then get yourself moving!”

00:19:52.670 --> 00:19:53.760
Right?

00:19:52.670 --> 00:19:53.760
Right?

00:20:00.300 --> 00:20:02.010
Oh, those two are hopeless...

00:20:02.890 --> 00:20:03.970
What’s wrong?

00:20:03.970 --> 00:20:06.640
The friends I was supposed to meet.

00:20:06.640 --> 00:20:07.980
Oh, well.

00:20:07.980 --> 00:20:08.940
I’ll be off.

00:20:08.940 --> 00:20:11.520
Right. Let’s meet again someday.

00:20:11.520 --> 00:20:12.650
See you, then!

00:20:18.450 --> 00:20:20.280
Koharu!

00:20:20.280 --> 00:20:22.030
Sheesh, what took you so long?!

00:20:22.030 --> 00:20:23.660
I battled Mr. Mikuri!

00:20:23.660 --> 00:20:25.290
I caught a Tyltalis!

00:20:25.290 --> 00:20:26.290
Satoshi!

00:20:27.330 --> 00:20:28.330
Serena!

00:20:28.330 --> 00:20:29.540
It’s been so long...!

00:20:29.540 --> 00:20:30.830
Doing good?

00:20:30.830 --> 00:20:33.090
Yeah, I’ve been doing great!

00:20:33.090 --> 00:20:34.840
Pikachu looks good, too.

00:20:36.010 --> 00:20:37.550
You know each other?

00:20:37.550 --> 00:20:39.840
We used to travel together!

00:20:46.730 --> 00:20:50.440
I’m competing in this
Championships thing right now,

00:20:50.440 --> 00:20:52.730
trying to become the best battler!

00:20:52.730 --> 00:20:56.360
I’m taking part in Contest Lives!

00:20:56.360 --> 00:21:00.990
If you’re going to be the best,
I’ll aim to be the best performer, too!

00:21:00.990 --> 00:21:03.240
Let’s both do our best!

00:21:03.240 --> 00:21:05.580
Yeah! I will!

00:21:05.580 --> 00:21:09.080
Satoshi and Koharu,
I’ll be cheering for you both!

00:21:09.080 --> 00:21:11.420
Me too! See you again!

00:21:11.420 --> 00:21:13.460
Thank you!

00:21:29.100 --> 00:21:29.980
Let’s go!

00:21:31.770 --> 00:21:37.280
Satoshi and Serena are both giving everything they have
to try and make their dreams come true.

00:21:37.280 --> 00:21:41.660
Maybe someday Koharu will
find her own dream, too.

00:23:07.200 --> 00:23:09.030
Now! Onto the next adventure!

00:23:09.030 --> 00:23:11.240
Let’s go!

00:23:11.870 --> 00:23:13.540
Next time:
Team Rocket gets free rein!

00:23:13.540 --> 00:23:14.580
Free rein to say anything!

00:23:14.580 --> 00:23:17.250
Keep an ear out for
my eloquent free talk!

00:23:17.250 --> 00:23:18.500
And my handsome voice talk.

00:23:18.500 --> 00:23:20.630
And my casual comedic timing!

00:23:20.630 --> 00:23:23.630
A new program by Team Rocket,
for Team Rocket agents,

00:23:23.630 --> 00:23:25.550
Team Rocket’s Secret Kingdom Radio!

00:23:25.550 --> 00:23:26.510
With a rock star attitude...

00:23:26.970 --> 00:23:29.140
<i>Let’s catch Team Rocket Agents!</i>

00:23:29.140 --> 00:23:30.510
Next time, on Pocket Monsters:

00:23:30.510 --> 00:23:31.350
<i>A New Program!</i>

00:23:31.350 --> 00:23:32.020
Team Rocket’s...

00:23:32.020 --> 00:23:32.430
...Secret...

00:23:32.430 --> 00:23:34.020
...Kingdom Radio!!
